Morphe and gmaps-patches portions
---------------------------------
https://github.com/MorpheApp/morphe-patches-library
https://github.com/MorpheApp/morphe-patches-template
https://github.com/fangkampanat/gmaps-patches

These files come from Morphe projects or from gmaps-patches (the same author's
patches for phone Google Maps, which build on Morphe code) and keep their
original headers. Some are modified for this project:

- CrashLogPatch.java, GmsCoreSupportPatch.java, ThemeUtils.java and
  CustomDialog.java (Morphe, with their file-specific notices)
- PatchListGenerator.kt (Morphe patches template)
- the shared extension library under extensions/shared/library
  (Morphe, through gmaps-patches)
- BydEnergyReader.java, BydVehicleModel.java, NavigationTtsWarmup.java and
  LocationServicePatch.java (gmaps-patches)
- .github/scripts/generate_patches_readme.py and docs/build-setup.md
  (gmaps-patches)

